{"author":{"id":"e8ccbc170af88335916e23a1b24e48c04b0a4af82e988d5245cc91e39d6a9e2c"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1794491123,"nonce":"4Gg/kgS1CqGJ1U7ZAZCsrA5WiHE=","title":"L5 — Presets, advocate/judge prompts and validated output schemas","message":"## Context\nThe adversarial evaluation: one advocate per product, one judge, plus extraction from pasted text or images. Gemini output must be validated so a hallucinated winner or spec never reaches the UI. This layer is plan Task 7 (`docs/superpowers/plans/2026-11-12-maeve.md:272`).\n\n## Files\n- `src/llm/prompts.rs`, `src/llm/schema.rs` — new\n- `src/i18n.rs` — new, minimal: `pub enum Lang { Es, En }` (serde, `Default = Es`) only. The UI epic adds `Key`/`t()` later\n\n## Approach\n- Implement plan Task 7 Interfaces: `Preset` with the three fixed criteria strings, `EvalContext`, `advocate_request`, `judge_request`, `extraction_request`, `AdvocateOutput`, `JudgeOutput`, `AlignedRow`/`AlignedCell`/`Better`, `parse_advocate`, `parse_judge`, `extraction_into_product`\n- Schemas as `serde_json::json!` in Gemini `responseSchema` format\n\n## Depends on\nL1 — `Product`, `CostBreakdown`; L4 — `LlmRequest`, `Part`, `LlmError`\n\n## Out of scope\n- Calling Gemini or retrying (L7)\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- Plan Task 7 Step 1 tests pass: prompts include \"use only the data provided\", the purpose, \"Respond in Spanish\" for `Es`, landed totals with tax lines, unknown shipping rendered as unknown, `price_is_range` rendered as \"from\", TEMU reviews labelled lower-trust\n- `parse_judge` rejects an out-of-range winner and a wrong-length `scores`, and nulls any `spec_key` not present in that product's specs (Review Focus 3)\n- Gates pass: `cargo fmt --check`, `cargo clippy --all-targets -- -D warnings`, `cargo test`","files":null}]}